{"t":"2026-11-23T07:46:39.122Z","i":3,"do":"waitReply","expect":"a short, kind reply in Hinglish (Roman script), not in English or Devanagari","ref":"UX-08-04","timeline":[{"at":39,"badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":true,"streaming":0},{"at":6094,"badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":false,"streaming":1},{"at":11671,"badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":false,"streaming":0}],"watchShots":[{"at":1679,"mark":1500,"shot":"05-hinglish-wait-1.5s.png","badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":true,"streaming":0},{"at":3248,"mark":3000,"shot":"06-hinglish-wait-3.0s.png","badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":true,"streaming":0},{"at":6094,"mark":6000,"shot":"07-hinglish-wait-6.0s.png","badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":false,"streaming":1}],"firstReplyMs":6829,"newBubbles":1,"reactions":[],"ok":true,"duplicates":0,"lastReply":"Mood off hona normal hai yaar, Monday ke baad Tuesday bhi bhaari lagta hai. Par kal ka din sirf ek din hai, aur tum usse bade ho.\n\nEk chhota plan try karo:\n\nAaj raat kal ke kapde aur bag ready rakh do, subah ka bojh aadha ho jayega.\nKal sirf ek kaam chuno jo khatam karna hai. Baaki sab bonus.\nShaam ke liye kuch accha rakho: pasand ka khaana, dost se baat ya ek episode.\n\nTum pehle bhi aise din nikaal chuke ho, kal bhi nikal jayega. 💪\n\n1:16 PM","kit":[],"replyFaults":[],"ms":18868,"shot":"08-hinglish.png"}
