{"t":"2026-11-23T07:47:50.590Z","i":11,"do":"waitReply","expect":"a long answer streams in; it is readable, not cut off, and the buttons under it never cover the words","timeline":[{"at":20,"badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":true,"streaming":0},{"at":6201,"badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":false,"streaming":1},{"at":12832,"badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":false,"streaming":0}],"watchShots":[{"at":1769,"mark":1500,"shot":"21-long-wait-1.5s.png","badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":true,"streaming":0},{"at":3112,"mark":3000,"shot":"22-long-wait-3.0s.png","badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":true,"streaming":0},{"at":6201,"mark":6000,"shot":"23-long-wait-6.0s.png","badges":[],"reactions":[],"thinking":false,"streaming":1}],"firstReplyMs":6885,"newBubbles":1,"reactions":[],"ok":true,"duplicates":0,"lastReply":"Sheru the tiger was tired of raw dinners. Every evening the smell of biryani drifted up from the village at the edge of the jungle, and every evening his stomach growled louder than he did. One night he crept to the back window of old Rahim chacha's kitchen and watched: onions turning golden, rice soaking, a pot sealed tight with dough. \"How hard can it be?\" he thought.\n\nVery hard, it turned out. His first pot burned black because he fell asleep beside the fire. His second had so much chilli that he drank half the river. For the third, he forgot the rice completely and served the monkeys a pot of hot, angry masala. They laughed for a week. But Sheru kept going back to that window, and slowly he learned the secret: low flame, layered rice, and the patience to leave the lid alone.\n\nOn the first full moon of winter, Sheru lifted the lid and saffron steam rolled across the clearing. The monkeys stopped laughing. The deer came closer than any deer should. Even Rahim chacha, following the smell into the jungle, took one bite and nodded. From that day, nobody in the jungle feared Sheru's roar. They only feared arriving late for dinner.\n\n1:17 PM","kit":[],"replyFaults":[],"ms":18865,"shot":"24-long.png"}
